        "html": "<article class='wo002-detail-page live-visual-page discovery-page discovery-world' data-companion-context='world' data-companion-copy='This is a visual preview of the Feast World, not a published world guide.' data-companion-reaction='curious' data-progression-page><nav class='detail-breadcrumb' aria-label='Breadcrumb'><a href='/'>Home</a><span aria-hidden='true'>/</span><span>World</span></nav><section class='wo002-detail-hero'><div class='wo002-detail-copy'><p class='section-kicker'>A WORLD MADE FOR WONDER</p><span class='chip preview'>WORLD PREVIEW</span><h1>Welcome to the Feast World</h1><p class='wo002-detail-lede'>Follow candy-colored paths into a food-fantasy world filled with memorable characters and room for new adventures. This page is a visual introduction; a complete world guide and map have not been published.</p><div class='wo002-detail-actions'><a class='button-link button-link--primary' href='/stories/'>Explore stories <span aria-hidden='true'>&rarr;</span></a><a class='button-link button-link--secondary' href='/play/'>See browser games</a><a class='button-link button-link--secondary' href='/app/'>Explore the full app</a></div></div><figure class='wo002-detail-art'><img src='/assets/images/world/candy-kingdom.webp' alt='Candy Kingdom environment artwork from the TOADAL FEAST world.' decoding='async'><figcaption>Canonical Feast World environment art.</figcaption></figure></section><section class='discovery-band' aria-labelledby='world-atlas-heading'>\n<div class='discovery-band-heading'>\n<p class='section-kicker'>APPROVED ENVIRONMENT ART</p>\n<h2 id='world-atlas-heading'>Feast World atlas preview</h2>\n<p>This is a visual index of approved environment art, not a canonical map. The arrangement is for browsing; no geographic route or unpublished location guide is implied.</p>\n</div>\n<div class='discovery-scene-grid world-atlas-map' role='list' aria-label='Approved environment artwork previews'>\n<figure class='discovery-scene-card' role='listitem' data-companion-context='world-places' data-companion-copy='Candy Kingdom is canonical environment art; location details beyond the artwork are not published.'>\n<img src='/assets/images/world/candyland-calm.webp' alt='A calm candy-land environment from the TOADAL FEAST world.' loading='lazy' decoding='async'>\n<figcaption><span class='chip preview'>ENVIRONMENT PREVIEW 01</span><strong>Candy-land environment</strong><span>Approved scenery · no location guide published.</span></figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class='discovery-scene-card' role='listitem' data-companion-context='world-places' data-companion-copy='The forest portal is a visual world preview; no destination details are being invented.'>\n<img src='/assets/images/world/forest-portal.webp' alt='A lush forest portal environment from the TOADAL FEAST world.' loading='lazy' decoding='async'>\n<figcaption><span class='chip preview'>ENVIRONMENT PREVIEW 02</span><strong>Forest portal environment</strong><span>Approved scenery · no destination details published.</span></figcaption>\n</figure>\n</div>\n<div class='discovery-cast-strip' aria-label='Canonical character art previews'>\n<article class='discovery-cast-tile'><img src='/assets/images/characters/toadal-portrait.webp' alt='Toadal.' width='256' height='256' loading='lazy' decoding='async'><strong>Toadal</strong></article>\n<article class='discovery-cast-tile'><img src='/assets/images/characters/princess-lily.webp' alt='Princess Lily.' width='512' height='512' loading='lazy' decoding='async'><strong>Princess Lily</strong></article>\n<article class='discovery-cast-tile'><img src='/assets/images/characters/gully.webp' alt='Gully, happy and standing.' width='256' height='256' loading='lazy' decoding='async'><strong>Gully</strong></article>\n<article class='discovery-cast-tile'><img src='/assets/images/characters/gulper.webp' alt='Gulper.' loading='lazy' decoding='async'><strong>Gulper</strong></article>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class='wo002-detail-facts' aria-label='World previews, guest progress, and future regions'>\n<article class='detail-fact'>\n<p class='section-kicker'>LOCAL DISCOVERY</p>\n<h2>Your preview progress</h2>\n<p><strong data-progression-stat='discoveries'>—</strong> site preview discoveries recorded in this browser.</p>\n<p>This count reflects configured preview-route discoveries. Environment artwork is not tracked as a collected location.</p>\n<p data-progression-storage-status role='status' aria-live='polite'>Guest progress is stored locally when available.</p>\n<a href='/feast-pass/'>View guest progress <span aria-hidden='true'>→</span></a>\n</article>\n<article class='detail-fact' data-companion-context='world-cast' data-companion-copy='Character portraits are previews; published character biographies are not available here.'>\n<p class='section-kicker'>CHARACTERS</p>\n<h2>Meet the cast</h2>\n<p>Toadal, Princess Lily, Gulper, Gully, and the Feast Genies appear in canonical art across the site.</p>\n<a href='/characters/'>Browse character previews <span aria-hidden='true'>→</span></a>\n</article>\n<article class='detail-fact' data-companion-context='world-future' data-companion-copy='Future regions remain locked until approved location and story material is published.'>\n<p class='section-kicker'>FUTURE REGIONS</p>\n<h2>More of the world</h2>\n<p><span class='status-chip'>LOCKED · NOT PUBLISHED</span></p>\n<p>Future areas have no published name, map placement, or lore. This preview keeps them locked until approved world material is available.</p>\n</article>\n</section><aside class='toadal-companion' data-companion data-zone='hero' aria-label='Toadal contextual helper'><div class='companion-panel' id='toadal-companion-panel' data-companion-panel><p class='companion-label'>TOADAL SAYS</p><p class='companion-message' data-companion-speech aria-live='polite' aria-atomic='true'>This is a visual preview of the Feast World, not a published world guide.</p></div><button class='companion-to